              "age of that snapshot). Judge each row: does it belong there? A NEEDS YOU row wears its own repo in "
              "brackets (`[beta] *w5*`), but the RUNNING and SESSIONS bands print a track by its BARE NAME, so "
              "resolve every row you judge against `home/roster`, which is all of the boxes' repos "
